    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classA" kindref="compound">A</ref> class managing language definitions. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It stores language definitions, added programmatically or found in XML files, in specified locations and only if generic components are built-in. From these definitions, <ref refid="classQLanguageFactory" kindref="compound">QLanguageFactory</ref> generates matchers, indenters and highlighters for a text editor, according to a file name.</para><para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQLanguageDefinition" kindref="compound">QLanguageDefinition</ref> </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
